#: documentation/content/en/articles/hubs/_index.adoc:409
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Please contact the Cluster Administrators as documented at https://www."
"FreeBSD.org/administration/#t-clusteradm."
msgstr "请按照 link:https://www.FreeBSD.org/administration/#t-clusteradm[] 中的说明联系集群管理员。"

